+          "The complainant had to exhaust the ordinary legal remedies."
         ],
         [
-          "A hatalom köteles szavatolni az érdemi alkotmánybírósági normakontrollt.",
-          "The power is obligated to guarantee merit-based constitutional judicial review."
+          "Az érintettek kötelesek voltak előbb kimeríteni a rendes jogorvoslatokat.",
+          "Those affected had to exhaust the ordinary legal remedies first."
         ],
         [
-          "A jogállami rendben a kormány nem írhatja felül az alapvető jogokat.",
-          "In a rule-of-law order the government cannot override fundamental rights."
